        <h2>BBS.eonic.cloud — Coming Soon</h2>
        <p>
            We're setting up a BBS — a bulletin board system — at bbs.eonic.cloud.
            Using ENiGMA½, a modern BBS platform running in Docker on halbox. You'll
            be able to connect via fTelnet right in your browser, no client software
            needed.
        </p>
        <h3>What Will Be On the BBS</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Show notes for every podcast episode</li>
            <li>Downloadable Amiga programs — real executables that run in FS-UAE or on a real Amiga</li>
            <li>IFF image files generated by Ami, our Amiga graphics agent</li>
            <li>Message boards for fans to discuss episodes</li>
            <li>Retro computing community hub matching the show's aesthetic</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            The BBS ties into the retro computing theme of the show. It's not just
            a website — it's a place. A destination that matches the world we're
            building on screen.
